1790412852 The ratio is on the query time row, which is what each engine says the
1790412852 queries cost it and what the public board publishes. The wall clock row
1790412852 above it also holds a process start per query, which is this harness and
1790412852 not the engine, and on a small sample it is most of what separates them.
